OL,3,AThey strangled us, says founder of
OL,4,ARussian newspaper shut under pressure
OL,5,Afrom authorities
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt the editorial offices of Novaya
OL,8,FGazeta, they are packing up and
OL,9,Fshutting down.
OL,11,FEverywhere I look there are cardboard
OL,12,Fboxes and plastic bags. Everything must
OL,13,Fgo.
OL,15,FFor thirty years this has been Russia's
OL,16,Fmost prominent independent newspaper,
OL,17,Ffeaturing investigative journalism
OL,18,Ffiercely critical of those in power.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
